GFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-07-16T17:46:31Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T21:04:12Z","closed_at":"2025-07-18T21:04:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1 and 4.5-beta3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe following resource can be instantiated when run in the editor: `Res1.new()` returns a resource object.\n\nWhen exported without debug info (Windows desktop export), `Res1.new()` returns null.\n\n```\nclass_name Res1\nextends Resource\n\n# Does not work in release: calling \"free()\" prevents the resource from being\n# created with \"new()\" in release exports\nfunc any():\n\tfree()\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP, run from the editor: the game shows 3 labels, which should all include a resource name (something like `<Resource#-12321434>`)\n\nExport the MRP to Windows and make sure to unselect \"Export with debug\": when running the executable, the first label in the game window should show `<null>`\n\nThe resource including a call to free() is res1.gd. The other 2 resources res2.gd and res3.gd include testing variations which do not impact the release build.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21263148/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/u